abstract: "Simulation and analysis code for the Gamma-Code Consensus (GCC), including synthetic Kuramoto network experiments, EEG pilot analysis with Chennu 2016 baseline-holdout validation, HCP-derived Budapest Reference Connectome topology stress tests, OpenNeuro ds006623 fMRI validation, OpenNeuro ds003367 traumatic coma/DoC HARDI structural backbone analyses, OpenNeuro ds004504 neurodegenerative EEG P1-proxy analyses, and Hermann 2021 FDG-PET/EEG disorders-of-consciousness proxy analyses."
